===Noun===
{{en-noun|sg=[[witch]]-[[hunt]]}}

# A [[search]] for persons believed to be using [[magic]], in order to [[try]] them and [[execute]] them.
# An attempt to find and [[publicly]] [[punish]] people, usually whose opinions are considered to be [[subversive]] and [[dangerous]].

